WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
I use AI. I check its work.. Static reachability is evidence about code structure, not runtime correctness.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
1 / A malformed function reference fails. validateRecords was imported; the module actually defines validate_records.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:28.000
2 / Fix the binding, then run the same check. The repaired local import and direct call now agree.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:37.000
3 / A defined validator can still be disconnected. An import is not a production call path; test-only references do not count.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.000
4 / Connect the production path. This establishes a supported static call path. It does not prove every branch runs.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:55.000
5 / Dynamic lookup is unresolved. Unknown constructs never receive a reassuring PASS.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:05.000
6 / Check the real CivicAtlas pipeline. The offline rebuild verifies source hashes and reproduces the published artifacts.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:14.000
7 / Run the acceptance controls. Suppression, missing values, tampering, geometry and deliberate AST failures are covered.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Keep the claim as precise as the check.. Pauline identified the engineering problem and directed agent-assisted investigation.
